tured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_tratamiento_marcadores_atipicos", "label": "Conservaci\u00f3n de Marcadores At\u00edpicos (>= 7 goles, 43 partidos)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 1 (\u00a72.3)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los 43 marcadores de 7+ goles son eventos deportivos reales (expulsiones, colapso defensivo); excluirlos reducir\u00eda artificialmente la varianza natural, sesgar\u00eda a la baja el par\u00e1metro mu de Poisson y distorsionar\u00eda las cuotas te\u00f3ricas de equilibrio."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_particion_temporal_causal", "label": "Partici\u00f3n Temporal Causal Out-of-Time (80/20 sin Data Leakage)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 1 (\u00a72.2), p. 2 (\u00a73.C)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ordenamiento cronol\u00f3gico con 80% entrenamiento (3.040 partidos, 2016/17\u20132023/24) y 20% prueba out-of-time (760 partidos, 2024/25\u20132025/26), usando 16 covariables rodantes de 5 partidos estrictamente hacia atr\u00e1s y StandardScaler para suprimir filtraci\u00f3n temporal."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_distribucion_poisson", "label": "Distribuci\u00f3n de Poisson para Goles (mu_H = 1.45, sigma_H = 1.204)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 2 (\u00a73.A)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_aproximacion_hipergeometrica_binomial", "label": "Aproximaci\u00f3n Hipergeom\u00e9trica vs. Binomial (n < 0.05N, n < 190)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 2 (\u00a73.B)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_regresion_logistica_multinomial", "label": "Regresi\u00f3n Log\u00edstica Multinomial (L2, L-BFGS, Softmax)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 2 (\u00a73.C, \u00a74.3)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Alcanza 47.76% Accuracy, 0.468 F1 ponderado y 1.012 Log-Loss en prueba out-of-time (n=760) con calibraci\u00f3n probabil\u00edstica coherente mediante Softmax."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_random_forest_classifier", "label": "Random Forest Classifier (150 estimadores, max_depth=6)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 2 (\u00a73.C, \u00a74.3)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Alcanza 48.42% Accuracy, 0.473 F1 ponderado y 1.028 Log-Loss en prueba out-of-time (n=760), modelando interacciones no lineales entre volumen de remates y resistencia defensiva."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_factor_de_localia", "label": "Factor de Local\u00eda y Contraste de Hip\u00f3tesis Z (Z = -5.588, p < 0.0001)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 2 (\u00a74.1), p. 4 (Anexo C)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ventaja neta basal de +17.18 pp (45.47% local vs 28.29% visitante, 26.24% empate). El contraste bilateral frente a p0=0.50 (IC95%=[0.4389, 0.4706]) rechaza H0 demostrando que la local\u00eda es un factor estructural no aleatorio."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_disparidad_elite_vs_resto", "label": "Asimetr\u00eda de Local\u00eda: \u00c9lite Top 3 vs. Resto de la Liga", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 2 (\u00a74.1)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Top 3 (Real Madrid, Bar\u00e7a, Atl. Madrid; 570 partidos) logran 74.91% victoria local vs 40.26% en los 28 clubes restantes (3.230 partidos), donde jugar en casa solo equilibra probabilidades."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_comportamiento_distribucional_ofensivo", "label": "Comportamiento Distribucional: Medias vs. Medianas (FTHG, HST, HS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 2 (\u00a74.2)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "FTHG muestra asimetr\u00eda positiva (2.34 vs 2.00) por goleadas at\u00edpicas; HST converge de forma cuasi-normal sim\u00e9trica con umbral operativo de 5 tiros a puerta (5.62 vs 5.00)."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_asociacion_estadistica_vs_causalidad", "label": "Distinci\u00f3n entre Asociaci\u00f3n Estad\u00edstica y Causalidad", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 1 (\u00a71), p. 3 (\u00a75)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Principio metodol\u00f3gico central del estudio para evitar confundir correlaciones emp\u00edricas predictivas (remates o ventaja parcial) con mecanismos causales reales."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_hallazgo_tiros_a_puerta_calidad_ocasion", "label": "Hallazgo 1: Tiros a Puerta (> 5 HST) vs. Calidad de Ocasi\u00f3n", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 3 (\u00a75 Hallazgo 1), p. 4 (Anexo A ID 1)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Jos\u00e9 Luis Mart\u00ednez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "P(FTR=H | HST>5) = 65.23% (r=0.58; OR=3.86 en \u00a75 / OR=3.12 en Anexo A, p<0.0001). El remate no causa por s\u00ed mismo la victoria; tiros lejanos o d\u00e9biles (xG ~ 0.02) inflan el conteo, siendo la calidad geom\u00e9trica y pericia t\u00e9cnica la causa subyacente."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_hallazgo_ventaja_al_descanso", "label": "Hallazgo 2: Ventaja al Descanso como Variable de Estado Intermedio", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 3 (\u00a75 Hallazgo 2), p. 4 (Anexo A ID 3)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Jose Aldair Torres", "contributor": null, "rationale": "P(FTR=H | HTR=H) = 78.53% (OR=7.64, p<0.0001). El marcador al minuto 45 no causa directamente los goles del segundo tiempo, sino que opera como variable de estado intermedio del dominio t\u00e1ctico y desgaste rival."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_hallazgo_efecto_publico_pandemia", "label": "Hallazgo 3: Experimento Natural de Pandemia 2020/21 (40% Psicosocial vs 60% Biof\u00edsico)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 3 (\u00a75 Hallazgo 3, \u00a77.3)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "En 2020/21 a puerta cerrada, las victorias locales cayeron al m\u00ednimo decenal de 41.58% (vs 47.89% en 2022/23), aislando ~40% de la ventaja local en factores psicosociales (grada y presi\u00f3n arbitral) y 60% en factores biof\u00edsicos y de terreno."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_inferencia_bayesiana_odds_ratios", "label": "Inferencia Bayesiana y Estimaci\u00f3n de Odds Ratios (6 Roles)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 1 (\u00a71), p. 4 (Anexo A)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_hipotesis_conversion_goleadora", "label": "Hip\u00f3tesis 2: Conversi\u00f3n Goleadora P(FTHG >= 2 | HST > 5) = 69.14%", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 4 (Anexo A ID 2)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "\u00c1lvaro L\u00f3pez Quira", "contributor": null}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_hipotesis_asedio_ineficiente", "label": "Hip\u00f3tesis 4: Asedio Ineficiente P(FTR = H | HC > 6) = 40.73%", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 4 (Anexo A ID 4)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Cristian Narv\u00e1ez", "contributor": null, "rationale": "Acumular m\u00e1s de 6 c\u00f3rners reduce la probabilidad de victoria local de 45.47% a 40.73% (OR=0.77, p<0.0001), reflejando bloqueos defensivos rivales."}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_hipotesis_indisciplina", "label": "Hip\u00f3tesis 5: Indisciplina P(FTR != H | HY + HR >= 3) = 61.02%", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 4 (Anexo A ID 5)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Joan S. Mosquera", "contributor": null}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_hipotesis_eficacia_visitante", "label": "Hip\u00f3tesis 6: Eficacia Visitante P(FTR = A | AST > 4) = 48.71%", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 4 (Anexo A ID 6)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Rub\u00e9n Dar\u00edo Velasco", "contributor": null}, {"id": "informe_academico_laliga_frontera_estocastica_y_limitaciones", "label": "Frontera Estoc\u00e1stica del F\u00fatbol (Techo 50\u201352%) y Limitaciones de Datos", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "informe_academico_laliga.pdf", "source_location": "p. 3 (\u00a76)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El dataset carece de tracking \u00f3ptico GPS, xG tiro a tiro y variables intradiarias (lesiones, alineaciones, clima). Por la baja puntuaci\u00f3n y aleatoriedad inherente, ning\u00fan modelo multiclase supera 50\u201352% de exactitud sin sobreajuste; las salidas deben usarse como probabilidades condicionales."}], "edges": [{"source": "informe_academico_laliga_informe_tecnico_laliga_2016_2026", "target": "informe_academico_laliga_colegio_m